{"name":"复选框","description":"复选框是让用户独立选中一个或多个选项的表单控件 · 兴趣标签、筛选条件和同意协议都可使用复选框。每个选项彼此独立；只能选择一个答案时应使用 单选框 Radio 。","quote":"这几个选项不冲突，用户想选几个都行。","agentPrompt":"邮件、短信和应用通知请用三个独立复选框，允许多选或全不选，提交后统一生效。请验证每个标签可点击，并准确提交用户勾选的渠道。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-checkbox\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>复选框<span>Checkbox</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">这几个选项不冲突，用户想选几个都行。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">复选框是让用户独立选中一个或多个选项的表单控件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>兴趣标签、筛选条件和同意协议都可使用复选框。每个选项彼此独立；只能选择一个答案时应使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/radio?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"radio\" aria-label=\"单选框 Radio\">单选框 <b>Radio</b></a>。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"chk-col\">\n        <label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>前端</label>\n        <label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>后端</label>\n        <label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><i></i>设计</label>\n      </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>邮件、短信和应用通知请用三个独立复选框，允许多选或全不选，提交后统一生效。请验证每个标签可点击，并准确提交用户勾选的渠道。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>多条件筛选</b>：几个条件自由组合</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">筛选</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>前端</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>后端</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>设计</span></div><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:75%\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>兴趣、技能</b>等多选收集</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>音乐</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>电影</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>运动</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>读书</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>游戏</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>全选、批量操作</b>：一键选中整组</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>全选</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:12px\"></span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>设计稿.sketch</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:12px\"></span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>需求文档.md</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>单独确认一件事</b>：我已阅读并同意</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">我已阅读并同意<span class=\"mk-link\">《用户协议》</span></span></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">选项<b>互斥且只能选一个</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/radio?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"radio\" aria-label=\"单选框 Radio\">单选框 <b>Radio</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>选项 A</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>选项 B</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">互斥选项不应使用复选框</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">切换后<b>立即生效</b>的设置：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/switch?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"switch\" aria-label=\"开关 Switch\">开关 <b>Switch</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>自动保存</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">切换后应提供明确的生效反馈</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">触发<b>提交、删除</b>等操作：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/button?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"button\" aria-label=\"按钮 Button\">按钮 <b>Button</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>提交订单</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">复选框不是按钮，点它不会“提交”</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">大量选项不宜<b>全部平铺</b>：使用多选 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"选择器 Select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>北京</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i>上海</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>广州</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>深圳</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>杭州</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>成都</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>武汉</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>西安</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>南京</span><span class=\"mk-choice\"><i class=\"mk-box \"></i>…</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">大量选项平铺，占用过多空间</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"demo-check\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"box\"><i class=\"c-box\"></i></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"label\">接收产品更新邮件</span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">复选项</span><span class=\"pe\">Checkbox</span></button><span class=\"pd\">整行都能点，互相独立</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"box\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">方框</span><span class=\"pe\">Box</span></button><span class=\"pd\">勾选打对勾，部分选中显示横杠</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"label\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">文案</span><span class=\"pe\">Label</span></button><span class=\"pd\">说清勾选后会怎样</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">默认<span>Default</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>音乐</label><label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><i></i>电影</label></div><div class=\"variant-when\">多选或单独确认一件事时</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">半选（全选）<span>Indeterminate</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"chk-col\"><label class=\"demo-check half\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>全选</label><label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>设计稿.sketch</label><label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><i></i>需求文档.md</label></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">批量选择时，表示只勾了一部分</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">禁用<span>Disabled</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled><i></i>不可选</label><label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled><i></i>已选禁用</label></div><div class=\"variant-when\">该选项当前不可勾选</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">列表多条件筛选</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">状态</span>\n            <label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>进行中</label>\n            <label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>已完成</label>\n            <label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><i></i>已归档</label>\n            <span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">共 5 个项目</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n            <div class=\"checkbox-sc-li\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">官网改版 v2</span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">进行中</span></div>\n            <div class=\"checkbox-sc-li\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">设计规范整理</span><span class=\"demo-tag green\">已完成</span></div>\n            <div class=\"checkbox-sc-li\" style=\"border-bottom:0\"><span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px\">支付流程走查</span><span class=\"demo-tag green\">已完成</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">兴趣标签选择</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600\">选择你感兴趣的方向</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin:2px 0 10px\">多选，帮你推荐更合适的内容</div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px 16px;font-size:12px\">\n            <label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>🎨 设计</label>\n            <label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>💻 前端开发</label>\n            <label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><i></i>🤖 AI 应用</label>\n            <label class=\"demo-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><i></i>📊 数据分析</label>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:12px\">完成，进入首页</button>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">注册协议确认</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:8px\" placeholder=\"邮箱\" value=\"lin@example.com\">\n          <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:10px\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"设置密码\" value=\"••••••••\">\n          <label class=\"demo-check\" style=\"font-size:12px;align-items:flex-start\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i style=\"margin-top:2px\"></i><span style=\"line-height:1.5\">我已阅读并同意<a style=\"color:var(--brand)\">《用户协议》</a>和<a style=\"color:var(--brand)\">《隐私政策》</a></span></label>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:10px\">注 册</button>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">表格批量选择</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n            <div class=\"checkbox-sc-li\" style=\"background:var(--bg-soft)\"><label class=\"demo-check half\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>文件名</label><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">修改时间</span></div>\n            <div class=\"checkbox-sc-li\"><label class=\"demo-check\" style=\"font-size:12px;flex:1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>📄 首页改版.fig</label><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">2 小时前</span></div>\n            <div class=\"checkbox-sc-li\"><label class=\"demo-check\" style=\"font-size:12px;flex:1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><i></i>📄 设计规范.md</label><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">昨天</span></div>\n            <div class=\"checkbox-sc-li\"><label class=\"demo-check\" style=\"font-size:12px;flex:1\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><i></i>📄 需求评审纪要.docx</label><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">3 天前</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">已选 2 项</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">移动</button><button class=\"btn btn-danger\">删除</button></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input/checkbox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">复选类型输入框</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/checkbox/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">复选框模式</span><span class=\"reference-source\">WAI-ARIA APG ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/checkbox","markdown":"# 复选框Checkbox\n\n你可能会说\n这几个选项不冲突，用户想选几个都行。\n\n**复选框是让用户独立选中一个或多个选项的表单控件**·兴趣标签、筛选条件和同意协议都可使用复选框。每个选项彼此独立；只能选择一个答案时应使用 [单选框 **Radio**](/vibe-hub/radio?lang=zh)。\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 邮件、短信和应用通知请用三个独立复选框，允许多选或全不选，提交后统一生效。请验证每个标签可点击，并准确提交用户勾选的渠道。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **多条件筛选**：几个条件自由组合\n\n筛选前端后端设计\n- **兴趣、技能**等多选收集\n\n音乐电影运动读书游戏\n- **全选、批量操作**：一键选中整组\n\n全选\n\n设计稿.sketch\n\n需求文档.md\n- **单独确认一件事**：我已阅读并同意\n\n我已阅读并同意《用户协议》\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 选项**互斥且只能选一个**：使用 [单选框 **Radio**](/vibe-hub/radio?lang=zh)\n\n选项 A选项 B\n互斥选项不应使用复选框\n- 切换后**立即生效**的设置：使用 [开关 **Switch**](/vibe-hub/switch?lang=zh)\n\n自动保存\n切换后应提供明确的生效反馈\n- 触发**提交、删除**等操作：使用 [按钮 **Button**](/vibe-hub/button?lang=zh)\n\n提交订单\n复选框不是按钮，点它不会“提交”\n- 大量选项不宜**全部平铺**：使用多选 [选择器 **Select**](/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh)\n\n北京上海广州深圳杭州成都武汉西安南京…\n大量选项平铺，占用过多空间\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n接收产品更新邮件\n\n1复选项Checkbox整行都能点，互相独立\n\n2方框Box勾选打对勾，部分选中显示横杠\n\n3文案Label说清勾选后会怎样\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n默认Default\n\n音乐电影\n\n多选或单独确认一件事时\n\n半选（全选）Indeterminate\n\n全选设计稿.sketch需求文档.md\n\n批量选择时，表示只勾了一部分\n\n禁用Disabled\n\n不可选已选禁用\n\n该选项当前不可勾选\n\n典型使用场景\n\n列表多条件筛选\n\n状态\n            进行中\n            已完成\n            已归档\n            共 5 个项目\n\n          \n官网改版 v2进行中\n\n            \n设计规范整理已完成\n\n            \n支付流程走查已完成\n\n兴趣标签选择\n\n选择你感兴趣的方向\n\n          \n多选，帮你推荐更合适的内容\n\n          \n🎨 设计\n            💻 前端开发\n            🤖 AI 应用\n            📊 数据分析\n\n          完成，进入首页\n\n注册协议确认\n\n我已阅读并同意《用户协议》和《隐私政策》\n          注 册\n\n表格批量选择\n\n文件名修改时间\n\n            \n📄 首页改版.fig2 小时前\n\n            \n📄 设计规范.md昨天\n\n            \n📄 需求评审纪要.docx3 天前\n\n          \n已选 2 项移动删除\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[复选类型输入框MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input/checkbox)[复选框模式WAI-ARIA APG ↗](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/checkbox/)"}